         theme.textTheme.bodyMedium?.copyWith(fontStyle: FontStyle.italic),
       ),
     _ => baseStyle.merge(theme.textTheme.bodyMedium),
-  };
-}
-
-/// Builds the inline spans for a text block, overlaying the IME composition
